  "html": "<b>Ankstyvųjų krikščionių ikonografijoje galime sutikti neįprastą siužetą - Kristus vaizduojamas kaip filosofas.</b><br>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MjzT-DChlkQ/VAyvYDAsk9I/AAAAAAAABQI/pRomGjbew1s/s1600/49961-87537-58717-51323135377402.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"227\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191123010119im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MjzT-DChlkQ/VAyvYDAsk9I/AAAAAAAABQI/pRomGjbew1s/s1600/49961-87537-58717-51323135377402.jpg\" width=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Kristus vaizduojamas kaip filosofas su rankraščiu ir kaip Gerasis Ganytojas, nešantis ant pečių avį. Senovinis sarkofagas, ~III a.</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<b>&nbsp;Kristus vaizduotas su tipiniu filosofų apdaru (lot. <i>pallium</i>) ir laikantis rankose knygą.</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-fNGmKE8Ht2s/VAyvX4b5rvI/AAAAAAAABQE/4l6yV4zi8a0/s1600/415px-9818_-_Milano_-_Sant'Ambrogio_-_Sarcofago_di_Stilicone_-_Foto_Giovanni_Dall'Orto_25-Apr-2007.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191123010119im_/http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-fNGmKE8Ht2s/VAyvX4b5rvI/AAAAAAAABQE/4l6yV4zi8a0/s1600/415px-9818_-_Milano_-_Sant%27Ambrogio_-_Sarcofago_di_Stilicone_-_Foto_Giovanni_Dall%27Orto_25-Apr-2007.jpg\" width=\"221\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></div>\n<br>\n<b><br></b>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"246\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191123010119im_/http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-p-BY0TRPTos/VAyvYSK1-mI/AAAAAAAABQM/IUBPdhup6KU/s1600/shepherdphilosopher.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Kristus kaip filosofas ir Gantyojas</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-p-BY0TRPTos/VAyvYSK1-mI/AAAAAAAABQM/IUBPdhup6KU/s1600/shepherdphilosopher.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b></b></a></div>\n<b>Pasak&nbsp;</b><b>Andre Grabaro, senovėje sutinkamas bei paplitęs siužetas su laiku ėmė nykti ir tapo visiškai nebenaudojamas.&nbsp;</b>",
